Names
-----

PM-KUSUM, Jal Jeevan Mission (JJM) and eJalShakti are names of schemes
and services of the Government of India (the Ministry of New and
Renewable Energy and the Ministry of Jal Shakti, Department of Drinking
Water and Sanitation). KPMG, MAHADISCOM, SECI, OREDA, EESL and NIC are named
only as authors or publishers of the documents followed. The names are used only
to say which devices and services this module simulates. This module
is not made, endorsed or supported by any ministry, agency, utility or
company, and is not affiliated with them. The simulated portal is a
test double on a local address; it does not stand for the real
service.

Government documents
--------------------

No text of the documents is reproduced, and no sample message printed in
them is included. The sample messages in pmkusum/sim/samples.go,
jjm/sim/jjmsim.go and jjm/sim/ejalshakti.go are our own: built to the
layouts the documents describe (keywords, members and element names are
interface facts), with made-up IMEIs, IDs, values, hosts and
credentials. The documents are not redistributed.


